Package: EMTscoreData
Title: Single-cell RNA-seq datasets of EMT responses from Cook et al. (2020)
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Haimei", "Wen", email = "hudie.luoluo@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-1600-1210")),
    person("Tian", "Hong",
           role = "fnd"))
Description: Provides 12 single-cell RNA-seq datasets profiling epithelial–mesenchymal transition (EMT) in human cancer cell lines (MCF7, OVCA420, DU145, and A549) under TGF-beta stimulation, kinase inhibition, and time-course conditions, as reported by Cook DP and Vanderhyden BC (2020). The datasets are distributed via ExperimentHub as SingleCellExperiment objects.
